      <p>That last card is the quiet alarm of the whole dossier. The federal benefit system pays the retiree the same amount in every city. The provincial and municipal stack decides how much survives. Carry that identical senior to Calgary and the margin is +$5,614. In Vancouver, +$4,530. In Toronto, +$954. Ottawa sends the same cheque. The lower floors decide whether it lands.</p>
